4510 REM Magnet in Black Castle dungeon
4520 OB_RM(O_MAGNET) = R_BLACK_DGN
4530 OB_X(O_MAGNET) = 10: OB_Y(O_MAGNET) = 10
4540 REM Chalice in Black Castle dungeon
